flowchart TD
  N[Navigation] --> R[UI route]
  R --> P[Page/component]
  P --> A[User action]
  A --> F[Frontend API client]
  F --> H[HTTP route]
  H --> G[Authorization guard]
  G --> S[Service]
  S --> D[Domain/database]
  D --> DTO[Return DTO]
  DTO --> REF[Refresh/reload]
  REF --> OUT[Visible result]
  H -. broken .-> B1[Orphaned route]
  S -. missing consumer .-> B2[Backend-only]
  F -. stale/weak .-> B3[UI connectivity gap]
